<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy 30-yr Btp sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy 30-yr Btp sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a seventh tranche of 3.0 trillion lire worth of 30-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 7.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		     Nov 1, 2026	    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 7.26 pct		 7.35 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     8.28 pct		 8.39</p>
<p> Assigned price 90.25		    89.20</p>
<p> Bids	     4.358 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 3.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction on March 13.</p>
</text>
